<rule id="fallback-kept" category="functional_correctness">
<when>
removedContains: ["??"]
</when>
A read of an optional field keeps its `??` fallback.
</rule>

<rule id="fallback-added" category="functional_correctness">
<when>
addedContains: ["??"]
</when>
A new read of an optional field has a `??` fallback.
</rule>